{"id":"en_the-village-that-wanted-my-baby","title":"The Village That Wanted My Baby","titleEn":"The Village That Wanted My Baby","description":"Annie Hughes is drawn to Reed Bay Village by Zion Hunt, only to discover that the marriage certificate she believed in is a forgery—Zion is already married to Cora Dunn. The Hahn Clan has designs on her unborn child and wants Annie out of the picture entirely. The one person who stands between her and that fate is the Dragon Mother, whom Annie once rescued; she puts everything on the line to help Annie escape. A year passes before Annie comes back to set the Dragon Mother free, arriving at the same moment the Dragon Mother returns with a Little Drake.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-village-that-wanted-my-baby/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-village-that-wanted-my-baby/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Plot Twist","Redemption","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl4bo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-village-that-wanted-my-baby_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl4bo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-village-that-wanted-my-baby_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl4bo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-village-that-wanted-my-baby_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl4bo/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-village-that-wanted-my-baby_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"